@page "/"

<PageTitle>Spillgebees.Blazor.RichTextEditor</PageTitle>

<div class="doc-hero">
    <div class="doc-hero-brand">Spillgebees</div>
    <h1 class="doc-hero-title">Blazor.RichTextEditor</h1>
    <p class="doc-hero-tagline">A flexible WYSIWYG editor for Blazor, powered by Quill.</p>
    <div class="doc-hero-actions">
        <a href="installation" class="doc-hero-cta-primary">Get Started</a>
        <a href="components/rich-text-editor" class="doc-hero-cta-secondary">See Examples</a>
    </div>
</div>

<h2>Features</h2>

<div class="doc-cards">
    <div class="doc-card">
        <h3>Reactive editing</h3>
        <p>Bind HTML, plain text, selection, enabled state, and touched state directly to your Blazor component.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-card">
        <h3>Flexible toolbars</h3>
        <p>Start with basic or full presets, move or hide the toolbar, or compose its controls yourself.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-card">
        <h3>Two Quill themes</h3>
        <p>Choose the conventional Snow toolbar or the selection-driven Bubble interface.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-card">
        <h3>Large-content mode</h3>
        <p>Use the passive editor to synchronize large documents and embedded content only when your app needs it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-card">
        <h3>Accessible navigation</h3>
        <p>Opt into keyboard behavior that lets Tab move focus out of the editor instead of indenting content.</p>
    </div>
</div>
